+---
+id: task-003-validate-task-input
+type: task
+title: "Validate task input"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold, setting only `id`, `title` and
+     `status` (and any `--tags` or `--set` value). Fill the required frontmatter fields and replace
+     these placeholder comments yourself; `wingfoil memory submit` then checks the required fields,
+     moves `status` forward and commits the document as you left it, naming in the commit body the
+     content it carries. -->
+
+## Outcome
+
+Validated task titles, priorities, and tags on add, rename, and tag operations. Invalid input now
+returns an `invalid-input` result explaining the violated rule and leaves the task list unchanged.
+
+## Verification
+
+Added red-first regression tests for every invalid-input category and for rejected rename/tag
+operations preserving the existing task. `npm test` passes.
